  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 170, Number 110 (Tuesday, July 2, 2024)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. SCHWEIKERT:\nH.R. 8929.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nArticle 1 Section 8\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nTo prohibit digital platforms from using information about\na user unless the user consents to such use, to ensure\npersonal information is considered a property right, and for\nother purposes.\n[Page H4452]\n</pre>",
